Wat je gaat doen As a warehouse employee at UPS, you make sure clothing, lingerie and accessories are correctly processed and prepared for shipment. You will work on different parts of the logistics process.

Your tasks include:
- Checking clothing, lingerie and accessories;
- Picking orders with a hand scanner;
- Sorting and packing products;
- Checking labels and product information;
- Processing returns;
- Preparing orders for shipment;
- Keeping your workplace clean and organized;
- Helping with other tasks when needed.

   Wat we je bieden At UPS, you get more than just a job. You will work in an international environment where your work is valued and where you can develop your skills.
- Up to €18.75 gross per hour including shift allowance;
- Starting salary of €15.00 gross per hour;
- 25% shift allowance after 19:00;
- 32 to 40 hours per week;
- Working in a 2-shift schedule from 05:45 to 14:45 or from 14:45 to 23:45;
- 25 vacation days;
- 8% holiday allowance;
- Travel allowance up to €9.47 net per working day;
- Opportunities to grow within UPS;
- Working in an international and diverse team.

At Start People, we operate on the principle of equal pay; your terms and conditions of employment always match those of colleagues who are employed directly by the client. This means that, in addition to your hourly rate, your terms and conditions of employment also include, for example, the number of days off, allowances, time-off-in-lieu payments and other pay components.
   Functie-eisen We are looking for a motivated and flexible team player who works accurately and enjoys working in an international logistics environment.
- You speak and understand English;
- You are available for 32 to 40 hours per week;
- You are willing to work in a 2-shift schedule;
- You do not mind doing repetitive work;
- You work accurately and pay attention to detail;
- You are motivated and flexible;
- No previous warehouse experience is required.

